    <code code="42349-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Reason for referral (narrative)"/>
    <title>Reason for Referral</title>
    <text><paragraph>Please evaluate and advise on chronic post-traumatic headache, not intractable and unspecified intracranial injury with loss of consciousness status unknown, sequela. [S]</paragraph><paragraph>Neurology referral for lifelong spells after a head injury, to decide whether they are seizures or sleep attacks. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
